>>> -	/*
>>> -	 * WFE arg_b
>>> -	 * bit 0-11: wait value
>>> -	 * bit 15: 1 - wait, 0 - no wait
>>> -	 * bit 16-27: update value
>>> -	 * bit 31: 1 - update, 0 - no update
>>> -	 */
>>
>> I have no strong opinion of CMDQ_WFE_OPTION but if you want to introduce it,
